				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d8572e79-0861-d2cb-1470-24d0fff02582")
	)
	(text "XA, XB: unused and floating (datasheet 7.5); the reference is the TCXO on CLKIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 303.53 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f45ac9ee-9b8d-6a07-a1ae-5d33edb6bfff")
	)
	(text "25.000000 MHz, 0/3.3 V HCMOS, +/-2.5 ppm (-30..+85 C)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 107.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5f12e2d-b96e-4fdd-0178-434d534d4b46")
	)
	(text_box "WHY ONE FAN-OUT, item 22.  Rev A's five 74LVC1G34 drove the channels in blocks (U3004 units 1-4, U3006 units 9-11, ...) off +3V3_A beside the squarers.  With every unit on one OCXO (round 45.20-45.22): pairs within a block 7-15 ps\nper transition, between blocks 20-53 ps; a channel's state moved its whole block 2-3 ps; and the blocks drifted 4-4.5 ps/K apart.  Two LMK1C1108 side by side, one input, on FO_VDD: 20 fs additive, 55 ps static skew within a part,\n280 ps between the two (a per-channel constant).  33R series-terminates each branch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 345.44 0)
		(size 560.07 10.16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 220 220 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3484d861-b502-585a-31b0-7879585f1c01")
	)
	(text_box "HO, ISOLATED (item 10).  CLK2 sits on VDDOB, its own filtered bank; the helper's CLK0 is\non VDDOA.  A buffer drives the jack, so the cable never loads the Si5351, and the Si5351\nruns it at 2 mA.  Round 45: at 8 mA HO added 16 ps rms to unrelated pairs (T2) and 53 ps\nper transition between helper groups (O6); at 2 mA, 24."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 111.76 0)
		(size 110.49 12.7)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 220 235 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b5e09d0-8772-2652-f605-e31738eb2660")
	)
	(text_box "CLKIN, NOT XA (items 9, RA1).  The FT5HN is an HCMOS TCXO,\nand CLKIN takes full CMOS levels (VIH >= 0.7 VDD, 3.6 V\nmax), so it goes straight in through 33R.  Rev A drove XA\nthrough a 3k3/1k divider and a slow edge; that edge was\nthe PLLA slip mechanism (RA1 fixed it on rev A: 0 slips in\n14 of 15 drive settings)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 62.23 111.76 0)
		(size 69.85 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 220 235 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca30b69e-b42c-c6f0-7197-7e280ce02079")
	)
